                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "673a0c0b-3d60-37ff-8c9e-500b92818767",
                        "entry_id": "8296d395-5758-3b42-910e-59f4899a8856",
                        "glosses": [
                            "górna część czaszki, znajdująca się wokół jej szczytu"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "literary"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f2b3e6a-8d99-47a1-b48c-c557e2c0b29c",
                                "sense_id": "673a0c0b-3d60-37ff-8c9e-500b92818767",
                                "text": "Na to gawędziarz całkiem już wyszedł z siebie i rąbnął go lagą w ciemię."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4339ba4d-00ae-4782-a164-b2464e0d784a",
                        "source_entry_id": "8296d395-5758-3b42-910e-59f4899a8856",
                        "source_sense_id": "673a0c0b-3d60-37ff-8c9e-500b92818767",
                        "target_lang_word": "sinciput",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sinciput",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05ae6a7e-417c-3537-b9ee-d1b358b248f3",
                                        "entry_id": "43a6091a-9d14-3914-ab86-e764e2ad252d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The front part of the head or skull (as contradistinct from occiput)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ef4094b-f79d-45eb-b8f5-97cb6c0c0b4b",
                                                "sense_id": "05ae6a7e-417c-3537-b9ee-d1b358b248f3",
                                                "text": "The cranial anomalies occurred either in the occiput or the sinciput, approximately twice as often in the occiput as in the sinciput.\nSuch lesions have been considered to be inoperable when they involved the sinciput."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e05c5833-321b-4edd-9c42-371846580ba8",
                                                "sense_id": "05ae6a7e-417c-3537-b9ee-d1b358b248f3",
                                                "text": "Between these two extremes lie the sinciput presentation and the brow presentation. Thus there are four distinct attitudes: vertex, sinciput, brow, and face (Figure 15-7)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcd9389a-ef4e-427f-9013-52a78f1dcf6b",
                                                "sense_id": "05ae6a7e-417c-3537-b9ee-d1b358b248f3",
                                                "text": "I learnt to develop a ‘feel’ for the sinciput and the occiput as these landmarks feel different abdominally, and also their ‘whereabouts’ in relationship to the pelvic brim. Therefore, when descent and flexion were taking place, I learnt to ascertain how the positions of the sinciput and occiput would change in relationship to each other and in relationship to the pelvic brim."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f12075c6-a700-41d9-80f9-55c419fabb7f",
                        "source_entry_id": "8296d395-5758-3b42-910e-59f4899a8856",
                        "source_sense_id": "673a0c0b-3d60-37ff-8c9e-500b92818767",
                        "target_lang_word": "coronilla",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9b8352c7-c795-4436-aad1-e2437d3b4709",
                        "source_entry_id": "8296d395-5758-3b42-910e-59f4899a8856",
                        "source_sense_id": "673a0c0b-3d60-37ff-8c9e-500b92818767",
                        "target_lang_word": "Scheitel",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Scheitel",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3844e444-1728-3b83-b5cc-3f9b1ec39524",
                                        "entry_id": "be485a98-1517-3e3e-b085-19ffafe63adb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Linie in der Frisur, entlang derer sich die Haare in unterschiedliche Richtung legen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5660184-0312-4a0a-945d-085ccb4ef285",
                                                "sense_id": "3844e444-1728-3b83-b5cc-3f9b1ec39524",
                                                "text": "Ich trage den Scheitel rechts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4b4f554-51a3-4b97-b78f-d5fef23aa75f",
                                                "sense_id": "3844e444-1728-3b83-b5cc-3f9b1ec39524",
                                                "text": "„Er fing wieder von vorne an, sich einen Scheitel zu ziehen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ce13e0f-580b-3c92-989b-d509470aad7f",
                                        "entry_id": "be485a98-1517-3e3e-b085-19ffafe63adb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "oberster Teil des Kopfes"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f32fd6bd-f288-4d28-93e0-546d3779bb21",
                                                "sense_id": "7ce13e0f-580b-3c92-989b-d509470aad7f",
                                                "text": "Die Körpergröße wird vom Scheitel bis zur Sohle gemessen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b8d2c75-180a-43ef-9af5-9683dca1ac52",
                                                "sense_id": "7ce13e0f-580b-3c92-989b-d509470aad7f",
                                                "text": "„Er reichte seinem Vater mit dem Scheitel fast bis an die Schultern: mit dem staubig weißen Haar, das ihm meistens ins Gesicht fiel.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1355e47-b790-4f04-a1c7-05072838ac4b",
                                                "sense_id": "7ce13e0f-580b-3c92-989b-d509470aad7f",
                                                "text": "„Simen Tjing ergriff eine Schere und schnitt ihr vom Scheitel aus der erfaßten Haarfülle eine dicke Strähne heraus, wickelte sie in Papier ein und steckte sie in die Tasche.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a304b2a9-a8f3-32ee-8154-16a7fa07e455",
                                        "entry_id": "be485a98-1517-3e3e-b085-19ffafe63adb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "höchster Punkt von etwas"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0a0c01c-927f-4fe6-a2fe-1eca73965247",
                                                "sense_id": "a304b2a9-a8f3-32ee-8154-16a7fa07e455",
                                                "text": "Wir standen auf dem Scheitel des Hügels."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f45cc19-94ba-3f95-b65b-0ac2f0111564",
                                        "entry_id": "be485a98-1517-3e3e-b085-19ffafe63adb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Treffpunkt der Schenkel eines Winkels und Punkte größter oder kleinster Krümmung von Kegelschnitten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "geometry"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7dd72411-98ad-4394-b2c9-d311b9709122",
                                                "sense_id": "8f45cc19-94ba-3f95-b65b-0ac2f0111564",
                                                "text": "Um mit dem Geodreieck einen Winkel auszumessen, muss man den Nullpunkt am Scheitel anlegen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d50712b-caec-4df7-b11c-35679d283a48",
                                                "sense_id": "8f45cc19-94ba-3f95-b65b-0ac2f0111564",
                                                "text": "„Aus der Scheitelform lässt sich, wie man am Namen schon erkennt, direkt der Scheitel der Parabel ablesen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"4\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a1458f5f-d9e8-48a7-9a27-052fcc881ce1",
                        "source_entry_id": "8296d395-5758-3b42-910e-59f4899a8856",
                        "source_sense_id": "673a0c0b-3d60-37ff-8c9e-500b92818767",
                        "target_lang_word": "те́мя",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "те́мя",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae94f599-bec7-3edc-8eb8-0fd55f1ed6a0",
                                        "entry_id": "e2e8ec0b-0bb4-3c9d-9bfa-1022feb9a183",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "анат. верхняя часть головы, верх черепа между лобными, затылочными и височными костями"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45d397d9-80c2-422b-9711-fd5be1c59e9e",
                                                "sense_id": "ae94f599-bec7-3edc-8eb8-0fd55f1ed6a0",
                                                "text": "Удар пришёлся в самое темя, чему способствовал её малый рост."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a8555e0-7732-4235-ad1f-558c82d07019",
                                                "sense_id": "ae94f599-bec7-3edc-8eb8-0fd55f1ed6a0",
                                                "text": "У Турбина нестерпимо ломило в темени от жары и водки."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2acc4cfe-1d32-4133-9483-17f41f9d028e",
                                                "sense_id": "ae94f599-bec7-3edc-8eb8-0fd55f1ed6a0",
                                                "text": "Мотька, босая, в длинной рубахе, стояла на припеке, солнце жгло ей прямо в темя, но она не замечала этого и точно окаменела."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a6059cc-838a-3303-a4f9-356353082ab7",
                                        "entry_id": "e2e8ec0b-0bb4-3c9d-9bfa-1022feb9a183",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "перен., поэт. верхушка, вершина (горы, холма и т. п.)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44cb996a-7207-445d-b591-4676ac46d395",
                                                "sense_id": "6a6059cc-838a-3303-a4f9-356353082ab7",
                                                "text": "На самом темени высокой горы, на которой построена Пенза, выше главной площади, где собор, губернаторский дом и присутственные места, идет улица, называемая Дворянскою."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
